      "short": "No cake left.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{1}{10}+\\frac{3}{5}+\\frac{3}{10}&=\\frac{1}{10}+\\frac{6}{10}+\\frac{3}{10}\\\\&=\\frac{10}{10}\\\\&=1\\end{align*}$$\nThe fraction left is $1-1=0$. Chloe has no cake left.",
